# Auth Modal

A comprehensive authentication modal with support for login, registration, and social providers.

## Installation

::div{.space-y-4}
```bash
bunx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/auth-modal.json
```

```bash
npx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/auth-modal.json
```

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/auth-modal.json
```
::

## Usage

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { AuthModal } from '@/registry/auth-modal'

const handleProvider = (provider: string) => {
  console.log('Login with:', provider)
}

const handleSubmit = (data: any) => {
  console.log('Form data:', data)
}
</script>

<template>
  <AuthModal 
    @login-provider="handleProvider" 
    @submit="handleSubmit" 
  />
</template>
```

