### Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `options` | `Object` | `Default labels` | Custom labels for all text elements in the modal. |
| `socials` | `Array` | `Standard providers` | List of social providers to display (google, apple, etc). |

### Events

| Event | Payload | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `@loginProvider` | `string` | Emitted when a social provider button is clicked. |
| `@submit` | `any` | Emitted when the form is successfully submitted. |
